gap-10 w-contain items-center" data-v-4c9fdba9><div class="left ml-auto w-full max-w-[500px]" data-v-4c9fdba9><span class="text-sm uppercase font-[500] text-[#868C98] tracking-[4%]" data-v-4c9fdba9>Context Aware</span><h1 class="text-3xl md:text-[48px] md:leading-[56px] font-[400] font-switzer tracking-[-1%] text-secondary mt-3" data-v-4c9fdba9> It Remembers, <br data-v-4c9fdba9> <span class="font-[600]" data-v-4c9fdba9>So You Don’t Have To</span></h1><p class="text-[#0A0D14] font-[400] mt-2 w-[80%]" data-v-4c9fdba9> GuildPay keeps track of your past questions and actions. so conversations feel natural, seamless, and actually helpful.</p><a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=2349119994024&amp;text=Hi%20GuildPay" class="btn-primary p-3 mt-5" data-v-4c9fdba9> Try It Out </a></div><div class="right w-full mr-auto sg-trigger" data-v-4c9fdba9><div class="bg-white max-w-[450px] mr-auto pt-14 rounded-[40px] relative h-full" data-v-4c9fdba9><div class="gibbit-tl gibbit inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-4 py-3 rounded-lg absolute z-[2] top-[50px] right-[0px] md:right-[-90px]" data-v-4c9fdba9><img src="/_nuxt/context-transfer-gibbit.87250502.png" alt="Gibbit icon" class="max-w-[121px]" loading="lazy" data-v-4c9fdba9></div><img src="/_nuxt/context-star.6da0dcf4.png" alt="Spending star for styles" draggable="false" loading="lazy" class="s-gibbit hidden md:block absolute z-[1] bottom-[-20px] right-[-75px] w-[150px] h-[150px]" data-v-4c9fdba9><div class="absolute z-[2] top-0 bottom-0 my-auto left-[-20px] flex justify-center items-center flex-col gap-4" data-v-4c9fdba9><div class="defaut-animate gibbit-ml gibbit inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 bg-white p-2 rounded-xl" style="animation-delay:0.1s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-4c9fdba9 data-v-31a73d37><p class="text-3xl md:text-[48px]" data-v-4c9fdba9>🧠</p></div><div class="defaut-animate gibbit-ml gibbit inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 bg-white p-2 rounded-xl" style="animation-delay:0.2s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-4c9fdba9 data-v-31a73d37><p class="text-3xl md:text-[48px]" data-v-4c9fdba9>💬</p></div><div class="defaut-animate gibbit-ml gibbit inline-flex justify-center items-center gap-2 bg-white p-2 rounded-xl" style="animation-delay:0.3s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-4c9fdba9 data-v-31a73d37><p class="text-3xl md:text-[48px]" data-v-4c9fdba9>💡</p></div></div><img src="/_nuxt/context-image.724d1f45.png" loading="lazy" alt="Image of a user using a phone to transfer money using GuildPay whatapp chat" class="w-full h-full object-cover max-w-[300px] md:max-w-[400px] mx-auto lazy-fade" data-v-4c9fdba9></div></div></div></section></div><section class="relative py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white non-panel-section" id="security" data-v-bbc6a700><div class="w-contain"><h2 class="text-center text-3xl md:text-[48px] md:leading-[56px] font-[700] font-switzer tracking-[-1%] text-[#20232D] mt-3 lg:w-[80%] mx-auto">Secured with WhatsApp’s Built-In Privacy Protections</h2><div class="flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-20"><div class="defaut-animate bg-[#F6F8FA] rounded-3xl p-3" style="animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><img src="/images/security-section/image-1.png" alt="Security Image" class="max-w-[100px] md:max-w-[150px] object-contain" loading="lazy"><h4 class="text-xl text-secondary font-[600] mt-3">Passcode for Every Payment</h4><p class="text-[#525866] font-[400] leading-[180%] mt-3">Every payment through GuildPay is protected by a PIN you create during setup. You’re in control set custom limits for when your passcode is required.</p></div><div class="defaut-animate bg-[#F6F8FA] rounded-3xl p-3" style="animation-delay:0.1s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><img src="/images/security-section/image-2.png" alt="Security Image" class="max-w-[100px] md:max-w-[150px] object-contain" loading="lazy"><h4 class="text-xl text-secondary font-[600] mt-3">NDPC-Certified &amp; Private Chat Security</h4><p class="text-[#525866] font-[400] leading-[180%] mt-3">GuildPay is now certified by the Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC), ensuring world-class security standards.<br> Secure your GuildPay chat by hiding it in a locked folder that only you can access using your phone's password or biometric ID.</p></div><div class="defaut-animate bg-[#F6F8FA] rounded-3xl p-3" style="animation-delay:0.2s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><img src="/images/security-section/image-3.png" alt="Security Image" class="max-w-[100px] md:max-w-[150px] object-contain" loading="lazy"><h4 class="text-xl text-secondary font-[600] mt-3">Biometric Login for Extra Safety</h4><p class="text-[#525866] font-[400] leading-[180%] mt-3">Your GuildPay activity is protected by your phone’s unlock. Want even more privacy? Lock individual conversation with a single tap.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 lg:py-32 bg-black z-[3]" id="use-cases" data-v-bbc6a700><div class="w-contain"><p class="text-sm uppercase font-[400] text-white text-center tracking-[6%] leading-[20px]">Send to any bank from GuildPay</p><h2 class="text-center text-3xl md:text-[48px] md:leading-[56px] font-[700] font-switzer tracking-[-1%] text-white mt-3 w-[80%] mx-auto"> Where GuildPay Fits Into Everyday Lifes</h2><div class="flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-10 md:gap-6 mt-20"><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="rounded-3xl overflow-clip p-3 h-[400px] flex justify-between flex-col relative"><img src="/images/everyday-usage-section/image-1.png" alt="Paying at a Street Food Stall" class="w-full h-full absolute object-cover top-0 left-0 z-[-1]"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-white px-4 py-2 rounded-full"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#FCCEEE] flex justify-center items-center"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 13 13" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4"><path d="M9.