14.6597C9.05041 14.6915 9.07498 14.7291 9.09167 14.7706C9.10834 14.812 9.1168 14.8564 9.11656 14.9012V20.3073C9.1168 20.3521 9.10834 20.3964 9.09167 20.4379C9.07498 20.4793 9.05041 20.5169 9.01934 20.5487C8.98829 20.5805 8.95136 20.6056 8.91069 20.6229C8.87004 20.6401 8.82642 20.649 8.78238 20.649Z" fill="#210F60"></path></svg></div></div><h4 class="text-lg text-secondary font-[600] mt-3 text-white">Haircut/Beauty Service</h4><p class="text-[#ffffff8a] font-[400] leading-[180%] mt-1">Get styled, then scan to pay. beautifully simple.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white" id="faqs" data-v-bbc6a700><div class="w-contain"><h2 class="text-center text-3xl md:text-[48px] md:leading-[56px] font-[700] font-switzer tracking-[-1%] text-[#20232D] mt-3 w-[80%] mx-auto">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="w-full max-w-[800px] mx-auto"><div class="questions mx-auto flex flex-col gap-6 mt-8 lg:mt-16"><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>1. What is GuildPay?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>GuildPay is an AI-powered financial assistant you can use directly inside WhatsApp. It helps you manage your money with ease by allowing you to send money, pay bills, track your spending, and gain insights into your financial habits—all through simple chats, pictures, or even voice notes.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.1s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>2. How does GuildPay work?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>GuildPay understands your financial needs using advanced AI that can read text, pictures, and voice notes—even in different languages. Whether you're sending money, paying bills, or checking your expenses, you just send a message or a voice note, and GuildPay handles the rest right from WhatsApp. It learns from your behavior and improves over time to make managing money feel effortless.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.2s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>3. Is GuildPay secure?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>Yes. GuildPay is built with security as a top priority. It uses end-to-end encryption, secure authentication, and industry-standard protocols to protect your data and transactions. Everything you share with GuildPay is private and securely handled. Additionally, GuildPay is certified by the Nigeria Data Protection Commission (NDPC), which ensures the highest standards of data protection and security in handling your financial data.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.3s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>4. How do I start using GuildPay?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>Starting is quick and easy. Tap "Try GuildPay Now" to open a WhatsApp chat with GuildPay. You'll be guided through a short setup process to register your account. Once that's done, you can start sending messages, voice notes, or pictures to perform financial tasks right away.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.4s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>5. What if GuildPay doesn&#39;t understand my input?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>If GuildPay doesn't recognize a message or image, it will ask for clarification or suggest how to proceed. You can switch between typing, sending pictures, or using voice notes. GuildPay is designed to learn and improve over time, so the more you use it, the smarter and more accurate it becomes.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.5s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>6. What if I lose my phone?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>If your phone is lost or stolen, you can freeze your GuildPay account here. This will immediately pause any transactions. GuildPay will guide you through the secure recovery process so you can regain access safely.</p></div></div></div><div class="defaut-animate" style="animation-delay:0.6s;animation-duration:0.5s;" data-v-31a73d37><div class="transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out px-5 py-6 border-b-2 border-[#F6F8FA]" data-v-2ae1eb54><div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer" data-v-2ae1eb54><h4 class="text-xl font-[500]" data-v-2ae1eb54>7. Does GuildPay support voice and multiple languages?</h4><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 flex-shrink-0 h-4 transition-transform duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><path d="M6 6V0H8V6H14V8H8V14H6V8H0V6H6Z" fill="black"></path></svg></div><div class="max-h-0 overflow-hidden transition-all duration-500 ease-in-out" data-v-2ae1eb54><p class="font-normal font-inter text-[#475467] text-sm pr-10" data-v-2ae1eb54>Yes. GuildPay understands voice notes and supports a variety of languages, making it easy for users to interact in the way that's most natural for them. Whether you speak English, Pidgin, or another language, or prefer talking instead of typing, GuildPay listens, understands, and responds accordingly.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><SiteFooter /></div></div>
</div>
